# §22.5 #8c wilderness-priest-teleport: pin the dungeon-context cast of
# priest teleport. Slot 1 priest at lv 1 (seed 5 wi=52, ma=52) covers
# cost (35 + lv 1 = 36) without the lv knob — same baseline party as
# revelation (#8b).
#
# Path 1 from §22.8: walk to a wild-roll cave at seed 5 (cave triggers
# on walk 4 of an 82828282... oscillation), enter with E. Two newline
# absorbers feed the back-to-back ryl_pause-gated narration blocks
# inside teleport's body (carefully/prepares/spends/chanting/candles +
# advance_hour, then picks_slab/satchel/wants_you/to). Compass key 2
# (south) and how-far digit 1 satisfy the loop+menu_branch reads —
# pa_teleport_step then walks the wilderness coords two tiles south.
# Direction 8 (north) is blocked by a mountain at (12,7); 2 was picked
# so the move actually lands. A trailing \n after `21` falls through
# the dungeon level loop's D/A re-prompt; `A` ascends; final \n
# absorbs the leave-cavern ryl_pause.
#
# Pinned arm: ma cost passes (52 >= 36), debit fires (ma 52→16),
# pa_teleport_step moves the party from (12,8) to (12,10) — two tiles
# south, both walkable grass. The not_enough_pts else-arm is not
# pinned by this fixture.
RYL_FAKE_EPOCH=1700000000
RYL_FAKE_SEED=5
RYL_NO_DELAY=1
